                                                "sense_id": "535066e8-882f-3be7-acfd-f6a825108f74",
                                                "text": "\"This shocking report proves once again that we urgently need a radical shake-up of hospital care,\" said Jeremy Hughes, chief executive of the Alzheimer's Society. \"Given that people with dementia occupy a quarter of hospital beds and that many leave in worse health than when they were admitted, it is unacceptable that training in dementia care is not the norm.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22bff08e-5e7f-4525-939e-6f1bf2f1fff8",
                                                "sense_id": "535066e8-882f-3be7-acfd-f6a825108f74",
                                                "text": "Private-equity nabobs bristle at being dubbed mere financiers.[…]Much of their pleading is public-relations bluster. Clever financial ploys are what have made billionaires of the industry’s veterans. “Operational improvement” in a portfolio company has often meant little more than promising colossal bonuses to sitting chief executives if they meet ambitious growth targets. That model is still prevalent today."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2d4eb7d-e2fa-42ef-81fc-4c20e891028d",
                                                "sense_id": "535066e8-882f-3be7-acfd-f6a825108f74",
                                                "text": "In this section, any reference to a director, chief executive, manager, employee or agent of a Scheme member includes a person who has been but no longer is a director, chief executive, manager, employee or agent of the Scheme member."
                                            }
